<title>INDIA: India's RBI lowers repo cut-off to 3.6 percent.</title>
<headline>India's RBI lowers repo cut-off to 3.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off rate of 3.60 percent at an auction of four day-repo on Thursday, down from 3.90 percent at the last auction.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 17 bids for 60.70 billion rupees of which it accepted nine for 50.20 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 3.5124 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
